         fhir:comment [ fhir:v "Element `Device.udiCarrier.carrierAIDC` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Device.udiCarrier.carrierAIDC` as `Equivalent`.\nThe AIDC form of UDIs should be scanned or otherwise used for the identification of the device whenever possible to minimize errors in records resulting from manual transcriptions. If separate barcodes for DI and PI are present, concatenate the string with DI first and in order of human readable expression on label." ]
