         fhir:comment [ fhir:v "Element `Device.property` is mapped to FHIR R4 element `Device.property` as `Equivalent`.\nDynamic or current properties, such as settings, of an individual device are described using a Device instance-specific [DeviceMetric] and recorded using [Observation].  Static characteristics of a device could also be documented in an associated [DeviceDefinition] instance. The Device instance's properties, and their values, could be, but need not be, the same as those described in an associated DeviceDefinition." ]
